{"seq":2,"slug":"cvp-analysis","title":"大学会计学 — 本量利分析与盈亏平衡","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/accounting/management-accounting/cvp-analysis","wordCount":1856,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学会计学-本量利分析与盈亏平衡\">大学会计学 — 本量利分析与盈亏平衡</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>本量利分析（Cost-Volume-Profit Analysis, CVP）是管理会计中最实用、最优雅的工具之一。它研究的是成本（Cost）、业务量（Volume）和利润（Profit）这三者之间的内在数量关系，帮助管理者回答一系列至关重要的问题：要卖多少才能不亏本？多卖一件能多赚多少？降价促销划不划算？这些都是经营中每天都要面对的决策。</p>\n<p>CVP 分析建立在上一节&quot;固定成本与变动成本&quot;分类的基础之上，其核心概念是&quot;边际贡献&quot;——每卖出一件产品，在覆盖了它自身的变动成本之后，能为企业贡献多少钱去填补固定成本、进而创造利润。理解了边际贡献和盈亏平衡点，你就掌握了一套能快速评估几乎所有&quot;量本利&quot;决策的思维框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"核心概念-边际贡献\">核心概念：边际贡献</h3><p>边际贡献（Contribution Margin）是 CVP 分析的灵魂：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>单位边际贡献</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>单价</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>单位变动成本</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">单位边际贡献 = 单价 - 单位变动成本</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单位边际贡献</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单价</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单位变动成本</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>边际贡献总额</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>营业收入</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>变动成本总额</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>单位边际贡献</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>销量</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">边际贡献总额 = 营业收入 - 变动成本总额 = 单位边际贡献 \\times 销量</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">边际贡献总额</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">营业收入</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">变动成本总额</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单位边际贡献</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">销量</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它的含义是：每卖一件产品，扣掉这件产品自身的变动成本后，&quot;贡献&quot;出来用于先填补固定成本、填满后开始产生利润的金额。利润的完整公式可以写成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>利润</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>边际贡献总额</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>固定成本</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>单价</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>单位变动成本</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mtext>销量</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>固定成本</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">利润 = 边际贡献总额 - 固定成本 = (单价 - 单位变动成本) \\times 销量 - 固定成本</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">利润</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">边际贡献总额</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">固定成本</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单价</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单位变动成本</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">销量</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">固定成本</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个公式是 CVP 分析的&quot;母公式&quot;，几乎所有问题都从它推导而来。</p>\n<h3 id=\"盈亏平衡点\">盈亏平衡点</h3><p>盈亏平衡点（Break-Even Point, BEP）是利润恰好为零、不亏不赚的销量。令上式利润 = 0，解出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>盈亏平衡销量</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>固定成本</mtext><mrow><mtext>单价</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>单位变动成本</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>固定成本</mtext><mtext>单位边际贡献</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">盈亏平衡销量 = \\frac{固定成本}{单价 - 单位变动成本} = \\frac{固定成本}{单位边际贡献}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">盈亏平衡销量</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单价</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单位变动成本</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">固定成本</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单位边际贡献</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">固定成本</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>直观理解：固定成本是一个需要被&quot;填满&quot;的坑，每卖一件就用单位边际贡献往坑里填一点，要卖多少件才能填满这个坑，就是盈亏平衡点。填满之后再多卖的每一件，其单位边际贡献就全部变成利润。</p>\n<p><strong>示例</strong>：某奶茶店每杯售价 18 元，单杯变动成本（原料、杯子）6 元，每月固定成本（房租、人工）24000 元。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>单杯边际贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 18 - 6 = 12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> 元</li>\n<li>盈亏平衡销量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>24000</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= \\frac{24000}{12} = 2000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">24000</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2000</span></span></span></span></span> 杯/月</li>\n</ul>\n<p>也就是说，每月卖满 2000 杯才不亏本（约每天 67 杯）。卖到第 2001 杯起，每杯净赚 12 元。若某月卖了 3000 杯，利润 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3000</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>24000</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>12000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 12 \\times 3000 - 24000 = 12000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12000</span></span></span></span></span> 元。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[销量增加] --&gt; B[每杯贡献12元]&#10;    B --&gt; C{已覆盖24000固定成本?}&#10;    C --&gt;|未到2000杯| D[仍在填坑 亏损]&#10;    C --&gt;|超过2000杯| E[每多1杯 净利+12元]\">graph LR\n    A[销量增加] --&gt; B[每杯贡献12元]\n    B --&gt; C{已覆盖24000固定成本?}\n    C --&gt;|未到2000杯| D[仍在填坑 亏损]\n    C --&gt;|超过2000杯| E[每多1杯 净利+12元]</pre><h3 id=\"目标利润与安全边际\">目标利润与安全边际</h3><p>CVP 不只算保本，还能算&quot;要赚到目标利润需卖多少&quot;。要实现目标利润 P：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>目标销量</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>固定成本</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>目标利润</mtext></mrow><mtext>单位边际贡献</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">目标销量 = \\frac{固定成本 + 目标利润}{单位边际贡献}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">目标销量</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单位边际贡献</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">固定成本</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">目标利润</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>奶茶店若想月赚 18000 元，需卖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>24000</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>18000</mn></mrow><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{24000 + 18000}{12} = 3500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">24000</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">18000</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3500</span></span></span></span></span> 杯。</p>\n<p><strong>安全边际</strong>衡量实际销量超出盈亏平衡点的&quot;安全垫&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>安全边际率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>实际销量</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>盈亏平衡销量</mtext></mrow><mtext>实际销量</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">安全边际率 = \\frac{实际销量 - 盈亏平衡销量}{实际销量}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">安全边际率</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">实际销量</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">实际销量</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">盈亏平衡销量</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>奶茶店实际卖 3000 杯时，安全边际率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3000</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2000</mn></mrow><mn>3000</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>33</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= \\frac{3000 - 2000}{3000} \\approx 33\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3000</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3000</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2000</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">33%</span></span></span></span></span>，意味着销量下滑 33% 才会亏损。安全边际率越高，企业抗风险能力越强。</p>\n<h3 id=\"成本结构与经营杠杆\">成本结构与经营杠杆</h3><p>CVP 分析还揭示了一个深刻的战略洞察：<strong>固定成本与变动成本的比例（成本结构）决定了企业的风险与回报特征</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本结构</th>\n<th>盈亏平衡点</th>\n<th>越过平衡点后</th>\n<th>风险特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高固定、低变动（如航空、芯片、软件）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>利润爆发式增长</td>\n<td>高风险高回报，销量波动时利润剧烈波动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低固定、高变动（如代工、餐饮加盟）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>利润增长平缓</td>\n<td>低风险低回报，抗销量下滑能力强</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>高固定成本企业（如航空公司）一旦坐满乘客，多卖一张票几乎全是利润，但在疫情等需求骤降时会因巨额固定成本而剧烈亏损。这种&quot;利润对销量变化的放大效应&quot;叫<strong>经营杠杆</strong>。理解成本结构，能帮你预判一家企业在景气与衰退中的盈利弹性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"一个降价促销决策\">一个降价促销决策</h3><p>CVP 是评估促销的利器。假设奶茶店考虑降价至 15 元做活动。新单杯边际贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 15 - 6 = 9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span></span> 元，新盈亏平衡销量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>24000</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>2667</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= \\frac{24000}{9} \\approx 2667</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">24000</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2667</span></span></span></span></span> 杯。降价后保本线从 2000 杯升到 2667 杯——这意味着促销必须把销量提升至少 33% 才不至于比原来更差。CVP 让&quot;降价换销量&quot;这个直觉问题变成了可精确计算的决策，避免了&quot;看似热闹实则亏钱&quot;的促销陷阱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>写出边际贡献和盈亏平衡销量的公式，并用&quot;填坑&quot;的比喻解释盈亏平衡点的直觉含义。</li>\n<li>某工厂产品单价 50 元、单位变动成本 30 元、月固定成本 60000 元。求：（a）盈亏平衡销量；（b）若想月赚 40000 元需销售多少件；（c）实际销售 5000 件时的安全边际率。</li>\n<li>高固定成本结构和高变动成本结构的企业，在盈亏平衡点、利润弹性和抗风险能力上各有什么不同？请各举一个真实行业的例子。</li>\n<li>什么是经营杠杆？为什么航空公司、电影院这类企业在需求骤降时利润下滑得特别剧烈？</li>\n<li>用 CVP 分析评估一个降价促销方案：某产品原价 100 元、变动成本 60 元、固定成本 20 万元。若降价到 80 元，盈亏平衡销量会如何变化？促销至少要把销量提升多少比例才划算？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>《管理会计》教材中&quot;本量利分析&quot;章节，配套大量计算练习</li>\n<li>用 Excel 搭一张 CVP 模型：输入单价、单位变动成本、固定成本，自动画出成本线、收入线和盈亏平衡点，调整参数观察平衡点移动</li>\n<li>分析航空公司或电影院在疫情期间的财报，理解高经营杠杆企业在需求冲击下的盈利剧烈波动</li>\n<li>实践建议：为你熟悉的任何一门小生意（咖啡店、网店、自媒体）估算固定成本、单位变动成本和单价，亲手算出它的盈亏平衡点，你会对&quot;要做到什么规模才赚钱&quot;有全新的体感</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>本量利分析研究成本、业务量与利润的数量关系，核心概念是单位边际贡献（单价 - 单位变动成本）。盈亏平衡销量 = 固定成本 / 单位边际贡献，越过平衡点后每多卖一件的边际贡献全部转为利润。目标利润销量、安全边际率等延伸指标帮助规划经营和评估风险。成本结构（固定与变动的比例）决定经营杠杆，高固定成本带来高风险高回报的利润弹性。CVP 还能精确评估降价促销等决策，避免直觉陷阱。下一节我们将进入预算管理与经营决策，把这些工具应用到企业对未来的系统规划中。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学会计学 — 本量利分析与盈亏平衡","id":"大学会计学-本量利分析与盈亏平衡"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"核心概念：边际贡献","id":"核心概念-边际贡献"},{"level":3,"text":"盈亏平衡点","id":"盈亏平衡点"},{"level":3,"text":"目标利润与安全边际","id":"目标利润与安全边际"},{"level":3,"text":"成本结构与经营杠杆","id":"成本结构与经营杠杆"},{"level":3,"text":"一个降价促销决策","id":"一个降价促销决策"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学会计学 — 成本分类与成本核算","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/accounting/management-accounting/cost-classification"},"next":{"title":"大学会计学 — 预算管理与经营决策","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/accounting/management-accounting/budgeting-decision"}}